{"assets":["/statement-assets/eb6d5ccc6658dbb635e23a66513d38df53fb394413d8d64fc71eb58e90d07649.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1990","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Polygonal Segments"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"8 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a$$$ of size $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A segment $$$[l, r](1 \\le l \\lt r \\le n)$$$ is called a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"polygonal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment only if the following conditions hold:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(r-l+1) \\geq 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Considering $$$a_l, a_{l+1}, \\ldots, a_r$$$ as side lengths, these sides can form a polygon with $$$(r-l+1)$$$ sides. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Process $$$q$$$ queries of two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 l r"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": find the length of the longest segment among all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"polygonal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" segments $$$[l_0,r_0]$$$ satisfying $$$l \\le l_0 \\le r_0 \\le r$$$. If there is no such "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"polygonal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment, output $$$-1$$$ instead; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 i x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": assign $$$a_i := x$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The first line of each testcase contains two integers $$$n$$$, $$$q$$$ ($$$4 \\le n \\le 2\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\le q \\le 10^5$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The second line of each testcase contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^{12}$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The following $$$q$$$ lines contain the description of queries. Each line is of one of two types:"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"kind":"list"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 l r"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" ($$$1 \\le l \\lt r \\le n$$$, $$$r-l+1\\ge 3$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 i x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" ($$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$, $$$1 \\le x \\le 10^{12}$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases will not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, and the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases will not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, if there is no suitable segment, output $$$-1$$$ in a new line. Otherwise, output the length of the longest segment satisfying the condition above in a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n5 6\n3 1 2 2 8\n1 1 3\n1 1 4\n1 1 5\n2 1 5\n1 1 4\n1 1 5\n4 10\n500000000000 500000000000 1000000000000 500000000000\n1 1 3\n1 2 4\n1 1 4\n2 1 499999999999\n2 3 999999999999\n1 1 3\n1 2 4\n1 1 4\n2 3 1000000000000\n1 1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n-1\n4\n4\n3\n5\n-1\n-1\n4\n-1\n3\n4\n-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first query of the first test case, there is no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"polygonal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment under the given condition. For example, considering segment $$$[1,3]$$$, you can not form a triangle with side lengths of $$$a_1=3$$$, $$$a_2=1$$$, and $$$a_3=2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query of the first test case, the longest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"polygonal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment is $$$[1,4]$$$. You can form a quadrilateral with side lengths of $$$a_1=3$$$, $$$a_2=1$$$, $$$a_3=2$$$, and $$$a_4=2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/eb6d5ccc6658dbb635e23a66513d38df53fb394413d8d64fc71eb58e90d07649.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An example of a quadrilateral with side lengths of $$$3$$$, $$$1$$$, $$$2$$$, and $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1990F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1990/problem/F"}